{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"be4eaced8b37613f11b25b9b86f9a1dc3bf0f583746a5ecd338b09ee5287bc62","ja":"帰省って、どんな感じ？","zh":"回老家，是什么感觉？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ed23c75c28bf6c516a61aa52870ee2afd2aa2d4483ce0834e186df09daedb7e1","ja":"ふむふむ……紬ちゃんは、もともと\n短めの帰省予定だったんですね！　知りませんでした！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"58d519c884f3f5624343cb1fbc4548ea8f6c5c3f25954ac6db14713d9fc34982","ja":"はい、年始に仕事も控えておりましたから……。\nできれば劇場でレッスンができればと。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bc3eb47820f569f33cdc20a74c4805c942fe387c813faa38787b16e21b41ff3f","ja":"おふたりは……帰省がどんなものか知りたくて、\n誰かが帰ってくるのを待っていらっしゃったんですね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f0a6cdbb8bbc977152daee98f7926ced1e9eda94ffad1a2bf8b196cd7b958be9","ja":"そうなんですよ～。ねぇねぇ、久しぶりの実家って\nどんな感じでした？　家族と会えて感動！とか？　","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3925f5d39463ac36db45124687e0b5a2b0f8ba3855640118a703d32880820fad","ja":"ええと……そこまでドラマティックではないかと。\n年に何度かは帰っていますから。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"25408de47cbea9d068003634740b5082bbb4d5379bf073e53c62f4054b7f137d","ja":"さすが紬ちゃん！　成長したお姿を\nこまめにご家族にお見せしに行ってるんですね！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b105bf1bdcfda1a959ca45a2a69b0f2a0757dade5ac5ece41b8c604fa509b581","ja":"そ、そこまで大げさなものでもないというか……。\nもっと気軽なものです。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6e8be53e29acfba9aa1ac85343a192a7f50fb8d20cc1e99532bab069bc6d9f40","ja":"いつもと違うことがあるといえば……団らん時間が\n長いのと食べ物が贅沢、ということでしょうか。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2a38fbb3b12e954560b006abc6c7240f090ee47f960c2d7dee0b289f3138c997","ja":"あ！　帰省すると、みんなで\nすき焼きとかお寿司とか食べるんですよね！？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"94709b0889e94ad9872ed817f2a2f09d07a032393bbc8f67bf0cbe205742007b","ja":"はい。他にも、旬を迎えた蟹やタラも……。\n実は、みなさんへのお土産にもしたんですよ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b0168749eb44d0c831eccebe1468114091c740c0133ef9ced8f620232a0c8e7d","ja":"えへへ。実は、その大っきな箱ずっと気になって\nたんですー。やっぱり美味しいものだったんですね♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"22a7630055a0ecf035e956ef0a0c3eaaf58ccfc514b28ee4f5aa624a59b985fc","ja":"はい。蟹は鍋を用意しないといけないので……\nまずはお菓子を食べませんか？　金沢銘菓です。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"ef3c2ab49f3051d57964cc550f68a3ef381448f6e2c189951365e403467abb7f","ja":"あっ、梅の形してる！　カワイイ～！　こういう\n地元ならではのお菓子があるのも羨ましいな～。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"8fa4f42d8f9b551f94192e1ed971ae9f0b3be3f93e2467f6c1b45577f09aeb4d","ja":"喜んでもらえて嬉しいです。あの……おふたりは\nご近所におすすめのお店など、ありますか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"5381a60defaf904079a57d89e5368dca5e2f45432ca4999dc3c6763f621e149d","ja":"はい！　最近、家の近くに美味しい\nパン屋さんができたんです！　塩バターが人気ですよ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7254553931cc10e3b9f6c8a9c52702c59d9cbf2ed2b16b9af6913e0a71d4da27","ja":"今度一緒にどうですか？　そ、そして、\nよければありさのおうちにぜひぜひ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a9a4193c2a1ef3922b07862b8734ab2cb511d80938b5fe4e74ebe3e14d0a60b0","ja":"はい。松田さんのお部屋、とても気になります。\n色々なアイドルのグッズがありそうで。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_982.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"84b8c6bdd4e3002944e70830729c845eaf4340a3aa808d677425da18976afa54","ja":"……私、実はこういう何気ないことで\nみなさんが羨ましくなることがあるんです。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
